 
 
      +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Programm: EIGENVALUE                                                    |
      |                  ====================                                                    |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  +-----------------------------------------------+                       |
      |                  | >>>>>>      Subroutine: REALEIG_2      <<<<<< |                       |
      |                  +-----------------------------------------------+                       |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  DGEEV computes for an N-by-N real nonsymmetric                          |
      |                  matrix A, the eigenvalues and, optionally, the                          |
      |                  left and/or right eigenvectors.                                         |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  The right eigenvector v(j) of A satisfies                               |
      |                  A * v(j) = lambda(j) * v(j)                                             |
      |                  where lambda(j) is its eigenvalue.                                      |
      |                  The left eigenvector u(j) of A satisfies                                |
      |                  u(j)**H * A = lambda(j) * u(j)**H                                       |
      |                  where u(j)**H denotes the conjugate-transpose of                        |
      |                  u(j).                                                                   |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  The computed eigenvectors are normalized to have                        |
      |                  Euclidean norm equal to 1 and largest component                         |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Compute all eigenvalues and eigenvectors                                |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Source: LAPACK 3.12.1                                                   |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  https://www.netlib.org/lapack/explore-html/index.html                   |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Suitable for medium matrix size - for small FEA exmples                 |
      |                  and suitable to compare issues with new algorithms.                     |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
 
 
 
 
 
